## WHAT GENESIS LUMINA IS

### One-Sentence Positioning

> Genesis Lumina helps SMBs (10-500 employees) stop bleeding time and money on AI experiments by building the internal capability and operational infrastructure to make AI actually work.

### What We're NOT
- ❌ An AI platform/tool
- ❌ A ChatGPT wrapper
- ❌ Consultants who write reports
- ❌ An agency that does work forever
- ❌ Selling licenses or subscriptions (except Ignite retainers)

### What We ARE
- ✅ Systems architects who use AI as one component of operational transformation
- ✅ Builders who deliver working infrastructure (not recommendations)
- ✅ The missing layer between "AI capability" and "business value"
- ✅ Exit preparation specialists (S³) who institutionalize what founders know

### Core Value Proposition

*"Most teams buy AI tools without teaching people how to use them. We provide the clarity, infrastructure, and internal capability so AI creates leverage instead of confusion."*

