- Deliverable: Meeting notes + clarifying questions

**Tuesday-Wednesday:**
- Systems mapping: Document current workflows
- Identify bottlenecks and prioritize
- Deliverable: Draft systems map (Miro board)

**Thursday:**
- Review call (45 min): Present systems map, confirm bottleneck to solve
- Define scope: What exactly will be built

**Friday:**
- Finalize scope document
- Deliverable: Scope document (PDF) showing what will be delivered
- Get client sign-off before Week 2 starts

