#### Week 2-3: Build

**Your work (30-40 hours over 2 weeks):**

**Step 1: Infrastructure Setup**
- Set up Make.com scenarios (or Zapier if they prefer)
- Set up database (Supabase, Airtable, or their existing system)
- Set up API connections (HubSpot, Salesforce, Google, etc.)

**Step 2: UI Build (if needed)**
