- Connect to backend/automation layer
- Basic styling (clean, functional, branded if they provide assets)

**Step 3: Testing**
- Test with sample data
- Test all workflows end-to-end
- Fix bugs as you find them

**Step 4: Client Testing**
- Give client access to staging version
- Have them test with real data
- Collect feedback, make adjustments

**Client communication:**
- 15-minute check-in calls Monday/Thursday (4 total)
- Async updates via Slack/email as needed

**Deliverable at end of Week 3:**  
Working v1 system ready for handoff

