#### Week 4: Documentation + Training

**Monday-Tuesday:**
- Build Notion Clarity Portal with all documentation
- Record Loom walkthroughs (3-5 videos)

**Wednesday:**
- Send Notion portal + Looms to client for review

**Thursday:**
- Live training session (60-90 min with their team)
- Record session for future reference

**Friday:**
- Final Q&A
- Transition to 30-day support period
- Send invoice for any remaining balance (if split payment)

